      "Re-run the loot.md section 3 keep-rate simulation — the 2.2% / 1.2% / 0.7% numbers and the \"1 in ~30-60 drops\" line in item-base.md both move.",
      "Confirm F3 drops/hour is unmoved: bias is a redistribution between frames of the same slot, never a change in drop count.",
      "Confirm the three item-base.md paths (cloth 248 / balanced 390 / armored 657 weight) are all still reachable — no settlement may make one school unobtainable.",
      "Only then decide whether a build must travel for a frame — if yes, that is a progression gate by geography and must be argued against world.md \"unlock by level\" first."
